//RS /// c109 Phase 25: the ambient prelude `input(...)` (D-PRELUDE1 = B, 65_io_prelude). A bare
//RS /// `input()` with NO user `input` fn lowers to `jet_std_io_input(None)` → `Result<String,
//RS /// IOError>`, composing with the `??` fallback. No stdin is provided, so `input()` errs and
//RS /// the fallback value is used (deterministic).
